title: "Hallucination-aware captioning, with an adversarial set I built by hand"
abstract: "Vision-language hallucination measured against a hand-verified adversarial set. BLIP hallucinates 4.5% but misses 29% of present objects; CLIP verification cuts hallucination 33-40% at a real cost in recall."
